# Input

```html
<math><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation-xml encoding="text/html"><span>x</span></annotation-xml></semantics></math>
<p>text<annotation-xml encoding="text/html">x</annotation-xml>text</p>
<MATH><MROW><MI>x</MI></MROW></MATH>

```


# Formatted

```html
<math>
	<semantics>
		<mi>x</mi>
		<annotation-xml encoding="text/html"><span>x</span></annotation-xml>
	</semantics>
</math>
<p>
	text
	<annotation-xml encoding="text/html">x</annotation-xml>
	text
</p>
<MATH>
	<MROW><MI>x</MI></MROW>
</MATH>

```
